%% 目标合同：完整发送消息流程（UC01-04）
%% 说明：此图描述 InteractionFrame 目标架构，不表示当前 im:* Emit 已替换。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SenderUI as 发送端平台 UI
    participant SenderHelix as 发送端 Helix IM
    participant SenderDriver as 发送端 Driver
    participant Service as IM 服务端
    participant RecipientDriver as 接收端 Driver
    participant RecipientHelix as 接收端 Helix IM
    participant RecipientUI as 接收端平台 UI

    SenderUI->>SenderHelix: invoke(ActionBinding: send-message, text 或文件引用)
    SenderHelix->>SenderHelix: 校验权限、频道状态和输入<br/>分配 correlation 与 temporaryId
    alt 本地校验拒绝
        SenderHelix-->>SenderUI: ActionReceipt rejected(validationErrors)
    else 已受理
        SenderHelix-->>SenderUI: ActionReceipt accepted(requestId)
        SenderHelix->>SenderDriver: Effect Persist(PendingMessage temporaryId)
        SenderDriver-->>SenderHelix: EffectResult Persisted
        SenderHelix->>SenderHelix: Timeline 与 Dialog Projector
        SenderHelix-->>SenderDriver: InteractionFrame sender provisional<br/>timeline Insert(MessageVm delivery=Sending)<br/>left-dialog-list PatchRow(PreviewVm)
        SenderDriver-->>SenderUI: 原子 apply 后渲染过程态

        opt 文档或媒体附件
            SenderHelix->>SenderDriver: Effect Upload(fileRef)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderHelix: EffectResult Uploaded(mediaRef) 或 Failed
            SenderHelix-->>SenderDriver: 上传进度 InteractionFrame<br/>timeline Patch(MessageVm delivery=Uploading)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderUI: 仅渲染 Helix 给出的进度
        end

        SenderHelix->>SenderDriver: Effect Http(POST /posts/create)
        SenderDriver->>Service: create post with correlation and temporaryId
        alt 上传或创建失败
            Service-->>SenderDriver: error
            SenderDriver-->>SenderHelix: EffectResult Failed(reason)
            SenderHelix->>SenderDriver: Effect Persist(Failed temporaryId)
            SenderHelix-->>SenderDriver: InteractionFrame sender failure<br/>timeline Patch(delivery=Failed retryable=true)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderUI: 在原消息行渲染失败和 RetrySend binding
            Note over SenderUI,SenderHelix: 重试使用同一 temporaryId，只 patch 原节点，绝不插入重复消息。
        else 服务端接受，最终事实仍以 WS 为准
            Service-->>SenderDriver: HTTP accepted
            Service-->>SenderDriver: WS posted (发送者 echo)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderHelix: HostObservation WsEvent(posted)
            SenderHelix->>SenderHelix: 收敛 serverId、canonical Message、Channel preview 与 cursor
            SenderHelix->>SenderDriver: Effect Persist(CanonicalMessage)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderHelix: EffectResult Persisted
            SenderHelix->>SenderHelix: Timeline 与 Dialog Projector
            SenderHelix-->>SenderDriver: InteractionFrame sender final<br/>timeline Patch(identity settle, delivery=Sent)<br/>left-dialog-list PatchRow(preview and order)
            SenderDriver-->>SenderUI: 原子 apply 后渲染 Sent

            Service-->>RecipientDriver: WS post (接收者 canonical message)
            RecipientDriver-->>RecipientHelix: HostObservation WsEvent(post)
            RecipientHelix->>RecipientHelix: 落库并按 recipient userId 投影
            RecipientHelix-->>RecipientDriver: InteractionFrame recipient final<br/>timeline Insert(MessageVm delivery=Sent, 若已 attach)<br/>left-dialog-list PatchRow(preview, unread, mention, urgent)<br/>unread-summary PatchTotals(按需)
            RecipientDriver-->>RecipientUI: 原子 apply 后仅渲染最终消息
        end
    end

    Note over SenderHelix,RecipientHelix: temporaryId 对账、排序、未读、@我和加急均在 Helix；各端只校验并机械 apply 强类型 Frame。
